# UI/UX Pro Max skills — installed per session, not vendored.
# 193 files / 5.2 MB of third-party design data. To reinstall:
#   npm install -g ui-ux-pro-max-cli && uipro init --ai claude
# Also needs (optional, only for the `design` skill's Gemini image generation):
#   pip install google-genai pillow   and   export GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# Small, self-contained skills are exempt and committed, so they load
# automatically: frontend-design and mobile-app-ui-design are a SKILL.md and a
# reference file each. The rule exists for the bulk, not for skills as such.
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/frontend-design/
!/.claude/skills/mobile-app-ui-design/
